<title>USA: Eau Claire, Wisc., GOs won by William R. Hough.</title>
<headline>Eau Claire, Wisc., GOs won by William R. Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R. Hough said it won $5.950 million Eau Claire, Wisc., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, of with a true interest cost of 5.23 percent.</p>
</text>
